"P3125795966" "Outer Gate sealed."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - TaskBeginFlashback 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - TaskBeginNoFlashback 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - TaskAbandon 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - TaskSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P3893993191" "The Forlorn tunnels have been sealed against further Ghoul incursions, though you detected signs of sabotage on the outer gates by unknown parties.<br><br>It's been obvious that the Forlorn feel for their feral brethren, having experienced that same red-soaked madness before they were cured. While he gave no quarter in his fights against the Ghouls, Noble Savage looked guilty every time one was slain.<br><br>The Palatine has promised to Demetrios that she will get in contact with Dr. Helix somehow. If Anna can manage that, the Forlorn might gain access to a Genetic Resequencer and grant a semblance of salvation to the Ghouls below First Ward."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P3659769041" "When you sealed those gates, {HeroName}, you cemented a measure of trust between the Forlorn and the Compound. Mistress Nadia and the Carnival have already convinced Dr. Helix to come to First Ward and prepared a safehouse to meet with Demetrios.<br><br>Your reports of sabotage, however, trouble me. Could it be that the Hetman's recon patrol was sent into the Forlorn tunnels to find some way to overwhelm Demetrios' forces with Ghouls? And if so, for what purpose? I must ponder this."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task - Mission3 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog - DemetriosDyingDialog 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Page DemetriosDyingPage Text :
"P1780186704" "{HeroName}, they <b>*cough*</b> were waiting for us..! The Hetman <b>*cough*</b> is under orders to prevent Dr. Helix from delivering the Genetic Resequencer..!"
// Answer Text :
"P1907962768" "Under whose orders?"
// Page Orders Text :
"P4081285582" "From Calvin Scott, of course..! When I took the Forlorn to First Ward, that lunatic branded us as traitors to his Resistance! That's why the Hetman had his troops open those gates, so the Ghouls would do the dirty work for him and save the Resistance some face!"
// Answer Text :
"P137726980" "Get up and let's put a stop to all of this."
// Page HetmanDidThis Text :
"P4200954994" "I fear that I am dying.<br><br>You must rescue the others. Mistress Nadia and Dr. Helix.<br><br>I believe <b>*cough*</b> Noble Savage is still in here somewhere, as well. Try to help him, too. The leadership of the Forlorn will be in his hands after I pass."
// Answer Text :
"P1115476952" "I'll get Dr. Helix and come back for you. Just hold on, Demetrios."
// Page DemetriosDies Text :
"P2326036277" "<color orange>Demetrios doesn't answer. His wounds have claimed him at last.</color>"
// Answer Text :
"P2141117208" "Leave."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog - LeaderDialogTree 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Page TaskOwnerPage Text :
"P1509681822" "<color orange>Only your task owner may speak to the Kill Team Leader</color>"
// Page KillTeamLeaderOpening Text :
"P2863654906" "You've been played for a fool, {HeroName}. My kill team? Guess what? We were just part of a much larger plan--"
// Answer Text :
"P2592892844" "--orchestrated by the Hetman. Give me the details. Now."
// Page Page1 Text :
"P1388004071" "Why not? You'll be too late to stop it anyway. As soon as you left the Compound, the Hetman declared martial law. That Shepherd witch and those Carnival freaks are going to be executed, along with anyone that sides with them."
// Answer Text :
"P4146323609" "That's not going to happen."
// Page Page2 Text :
"P293205145" "Yeah...<br><br>...yeah, I expect it <i>will</i>.<br><br><color gold>The Kill Team Leader expires from his injuries.</color>"
// Answer Text :
"P3246533762" "(Take the fight to the Hetman)"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// IntroString :
"P1081975344" "Mistress Nadia has set up the meeting between Dr. Helix and the Forlorn, and <color orange>I would like you to attend it, {HeroName}</color>. The Hetman has been growing nervous of late, and I must stay here to figure out why. I fear that he would do anything to trump an alliance between the Compound and the Forlorn, not to mention reforging the bond we once shared with the Carnival of Light. I will need such allies if I am to secure my title of Palatine and be fully recognized as the leader of my people."
// AcceptString :
"P4147155568" "If you move against him first, he'll appear the victim."
// SendOffString :
"P3201625241" "I am not suggesting a confrontation of violence, my friend, only the Hetman's acceptance of the Monarch's last command."
// ActiveTaskString :
"P2139095865" "Solidify the Palatine's Rule"
// YoureStillBusyString :
"P3307417600" "We haven't solidified my Throne yet. There is much to be done."
// TaskSubTitle :
"P3652642964" "<color deepskyblue>Finale: The Only Sure Reliance</color>"

